# Search-tool scope, not version control. Read by ripgrep, fd, and anything
# else built on the same ignore machinery; git does not read this file.
#
# Those tools skip dot directories by default, which hides `.github/` from a
# plain `rg`. Contributor process (CONTRIBUTING.md, SECURITY.md), the issue
# templates, CODEOWNERS, and every CI workflow live there, so a search for
# them silently returns nothing and reads as "this repository has none".
# Re-include the directory rather than teaching every caller `--hidden`, which
# would also drag in `.git/`.
!.github/
